  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The proposed single storey flank and rear extension would, by reason of their excessive size, position and appearance in relation to neighbouring residential properties, be unduly obtrusive, detrimental to the outlook and residential amenities of adjoining occupiers and the visual amenities of the street scene, and result in a loss of balance, out of character with the existing terraced houses. The proposal is contrary to the Policies ENV 1.1 (All New Development) and H3.4 (Extensions and Alterations) of the Unitary Development Plan and ENVB 1.1 (New Development) and H.6.4 Extensions and Alterations) of the Revised Deposit Unitary Development Plan and Supplementary Planning Guidance, Residential Extension Guidelines."
